{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56049","headline":"送[韩]（刘）（据诗意及《白莲集》卷九改）蜕秀才赴举 · 齐己","name":"送[韩]（刘）（据诗意及《白莲集》卷九改）蜕秀才赴举","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百发百中技，长[杨]（阳）献赋年。\n丹枝如技分，一箭的无偏。\n文物兵销国，关河雪霁天。\n都人看春牓，韩字在谁前。\n（同前）（按：《全唐诗》卷八三八收此诗缺五字，今重录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56049.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56049","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}